                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="delay-grid">
                        <div class="delay-box">
                            <div class="delay-box-period"><i class="fas fa-calendar-alt"></i> Em 1 Mês</div>
                            <div class="delay-box-val" id="delay-1m-val">R$ 450,00</div>
